I tried to upload a robots.txt files on my (free) shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> site. It does not seem to work . When I look at the live robots.txt from the Google Search Console all I get is:

User-agent: *
Disallow: /

This is not the file I uploaded and effectivly bans all bots from the site - meaning I will not be able to google my own site.

Is there a policy on robots.txt and does it change with some of the paid options?

Does anyone have any advice on how I can change the file that is currently there (or even just see what is in my directory on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>)?

