The link you sent helped me solve the problem.
I had the exact same problem as outlined in https://github.com/MarkEdmondson1234/googleAuthR/issues/57 <https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FMarkEdmondson1234%2FgoogleAuthR%2Fissues%2F57&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AFQjCNGgshqFiyUpyJSUOT9n2OIm35aHBg>

MarkEdmondson123 gave a workaround in that post to rather use googleAuthRMarkdown <https://mark.shinyapps.io/googleAuthRMarkdown/> and that works on both my localhost and shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>.

Thank you so much for the help!

