I assumed that I could just pass a vector of file paths, but when I do that I get an error.

> files
[1] "./YCC-Baseline-Conditions.Rproj"
[2] "./style.css"
[3] "./app.R"
[4] "./1-data/5-tidy/comb-long-sf.rds"
