The usage metrics are sampled, so if your application rapidly consumes the available memory <http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/applications.html#memory>, it will be terminated, and this can, and typically will, occur before the exhaustion is recorded.
You can try a larger instance type <http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/applications.html>, or investigate ways of optimizing memory usage.

