Dear Yihui and Joshua,

after adding

library(codetools)

in setup section
```{r setup, include=FALSE}
library(codetools)
knitr::opts_chunk$set(echo = FALSE)
```

it works. Thank you very much for your help.

Sincerely,
Yevgen.

